WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.120
Some word parts tell you when and where.

00:00:03.120 --> 00:00:04.800
Pre means before.

00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:07.180
Re means again, or back.

00:00:07.180 --> 00:00:09.000
Trans means across.

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:10.880
Inter means between.

00:00:10.880 --> 00:00:18.890
Find the part at the front, ask what it adds to the word, and set one more treasure back in its place.
